    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive hordes of monsters and bosses</strong> while collecting cards that add unique ability upgrades to the body of a small snake, <strong>Mechaconda</strong>. A reimagining of the classic Snake game with modern gameplay and intense bullet hell action. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all bosses created by Dr. EVIL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL THE LEVEL HORDES\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, become stronger, and destroy all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/aae13a1e598a72c4263975b41585a9c4.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/aae13a1e598a72c4263975b41585a9c4.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/aae13a1e598a72c4263975b41585a9c4.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Mechaconda during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/8f6ae323c716f4a2f1f318b6a9d697f1.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/8f6ae323c716f4a2f1f318b6a9d697f1.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/8f6ae323c716f4a2f1f318b6a9d697f1.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes: Campaign, Roguelike and Boss Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive hordes of monsters and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match upgrades for unique playstyles in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ cards with unique body abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ snake heads with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive hordes of monsters and bosses</strong> while collecting cards that add unique ability upgrades to the body of a small snake, <strong>Mechaconda</strong>. A reimagining of the classic Snake game with modern gameplay and intense bullet hell action. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all bosses created by Dr. EVIL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL THE LEVEL HORDES\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, become stronger, and destroy all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/aae13a1e598a72c4263975b41585a9c4.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/aae13a1e598a72c4263975b41585a9c4.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/aae13a1e598a72c4263975b41585a9c4.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Mechaconda during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/8f6ae323c716f4a2f1f318b6a9d697f1.poster.avif?t=1746455036\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/8f6ae323c716f4a2f1f318b6a9d697f1.webm?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/8f6ae323c716f4a2f1f318b6a9d697f1.mp4?t=1746455036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes: Campaign, Roguelike and Boss Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive hordes of monsters and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match upgrades for unique playstyles in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ cards with unique body abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ snake heads with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
